{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/advanced/temporal-runtime","title":"Temporal runtime","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"temporal-runtime","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Temporal runtime"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Craft treats time as a runtime capability rather than as a direct call to the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"browser or Node timer APIs. This gives asynchronous programs one temporal"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"seam that can be replaced in tests, inspected during diagnostics, and cleaned"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"up with the lifetime that created it."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use it when"}]},{"t":"text","text":" a Craft program needs a delay, timeout, retry backoff, polling"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"or another cancellable time-based operation."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Do not use it"}]},{"t":"text","text":" for civil dates such as timestamps stored in a database:"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"those are dates, not elapsed-time measurements."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"import","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Import"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  CRAFT_TEMPORAL_RUNTIME,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  craftSleep,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  exponentialTemporalSchedule,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  fixedTemporalSchedule,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  provideCraftTemporalRuntime,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  VirtualCraftTemporalRuntime,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  withCraftTimeout,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-temporal-model","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The temporal model"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The runtime separates three responsibilities:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"clock"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — reads monotonic time for durations and civil time for dates;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"task"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — schedules one cancellable callback or sleep operation;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"schedule"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — decides whether an operation continues and how long the next"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"wait should be."}]}]]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"Craft program"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ├── waits       → craftSleep(...)"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ├── times out   → withCraftTimeout(...)"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  └── retries     → a temporal schedule"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          │"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          ▼"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"CRAFT_TEMPORAL_RUNTIME"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ├── RealCraftTemporalRuntime"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  └── VirtualCraftTemporalRuntime"}]}],"filename":"","language":"","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"setTimeout"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"setInterval"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"clearTimeout"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"clearInterval"},{"t":"text","text":" are runtime"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"implementation details. A polling loop should normally be expressed as a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"sequence of operations and a schedule so it can stop when its owner is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"destroyed."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"waiting-in-a-craft-program","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Waiting in a Craft program"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craftSleep"},{"t":"text","text":" is a yieldable delay. It does not create a native timer when the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"generator is created. The asynchronous Craft driver receives the request and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"delegates it to the configured temporal runtime."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { craftGen, craftSleep } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"refreshAfterDelay"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftGen","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftSleep","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"500","kind":"number"},{"text":", { owner: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'refresh'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'refresh now'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The delay can be used in route guards and in asynchronous primitive loaders,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"which already use the asynchronous program driver:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"data"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"query","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'data'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"loader","kind":"function"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftSleep","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"100","kind":"number"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"loadData","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"When a query is retriggered, its loader abort signal is propagated to pending"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"temporal awaits. A stale "},{"t":"code","text":"craftSleep"},{"t":"text","text":" is therefore cancelled and its generator"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"does not resume. The resource still protects the latest result if an operation"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"has already passed its sleep or does not observe the signal."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Mutation loaders intentionally keep their already-started temporal operation"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"valid when a new mutation is triggered. The previous resource result can still"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"be ignored as stale, but the mutation's generator is not interrupted."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Synchronous drivers such as "},{"t":"code","text":"craftUse"},{"t":"text","text":" cannot suspend on "},{"t":"code","text":"craftSleep"},{"t":"text","text":". They"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"fail with an explicit async-driver error instead of silently creating an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"untracked Promise."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"replacing-the-runtime-in-tests","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Replacing the runtime in tests"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"VirtualCraftTemporalRuntime"},{"t":"text","text":" never waits for wall-clock time. It starts at"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"zero by default, orders equal deadlines by creation order, and exposes the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"pending tasks for assertions."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { ɵInjector ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"as","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" Injector } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  executeGeneratorCompatibleFactoryAsync,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  provideCraftTemporalRuntime,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  VirtualCraftTemporalRuntime,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"clock"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"new","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"VirtualCraftTemporalRuntime","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"injector"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" Injector.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"create","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  providers: [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"provideCraftTemporalRuntime","kind":"function"},{"text":"(clock)],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"result"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"executeGeneratorCompatibleFactoryAsync","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"factory","kind":"function"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftSleep","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"100","kind":"number"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'done'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  thisArg: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"undefined","kind":"keyword"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"getInjector","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" injector,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  args: [],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  invalidYieldErrorMessage: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Invalid Craft yield.'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" clock.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"advanceBy","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"99","kind":"number"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// The program is still suspended.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" clock.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"advanceBy","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"1","kind":"number"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"expect","kind":"function"},{"text":"(result).resolves.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"toMatchObject","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  kind: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'done'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  value: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'done'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The main test operations are:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" clock.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"advanceBy","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"250","kind":"number"},{"text":"); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// move time forward","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" clock.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"advanceTo","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"1_000","kind":"number"},{"text":"); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// move to an exact time","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" clock.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"advanceToNextTask","kind":"function"},{"text":"(); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// execute the nearest task","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" clock.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"runUntilIdle","kind":"function"},{"text":"(); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// execute until no task remains","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"clock.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"pendingTasks","kind":"function"},{"text":"(); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// inspect all pending tasks","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"clock.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"pendingTasks","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'refresh'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// inspect one owner","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"clock.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"reset","kind":"function"},{"text":"(); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// cancel tasks and restore the clock","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Tasks with the same deadline run in creation order. A task created while an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"expired task is running is then considered at the same virtual time and is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"also executed before the clock advances beyond that deadline."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"timeouts","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Timeouts"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"withCraftTimeout"},{"t":"text","text":" races an operation against the configured runtime. If the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"operation wins, the timeout task is cancelled. If the deadline wins, the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Promise rejects with "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftTimeoutError"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"response"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"withCraftTimeout","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"fetch","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'/api/report'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":").","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"then","kind":"function"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"response"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" response.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"json","kind":"function"},{"text":"()),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"5_000","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  { owner: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'report-loader'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The timeout controls the Craft operation's result. It does not automatically"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"cancel an external HTTP request. Pass an "},{"t":"code","text":"AbortSignal"},{"t":"text","text":" to the underlying API"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"when the resource itself must be interrupted as well."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"schedules","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Schedules"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A schedule is a pure policy. It does not own a timer and it does not run an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"interval. It receives the next attempt number and returns either a delay or a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"stop decision."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"backoff"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"exponentialTemporalSchedule","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"100","kind":"number"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  factor: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"2","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  maxAttempts: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"4","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  maxDelayMs: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"2_000","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"backoff.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"next","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ attempt: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"1","kind":"number"},{"text":", elapsedMs: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"0","kind":"number"},{"text":" }); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// { done: false, delayMs: 100 }","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"backoff.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"next","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ attempt: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"2","kind":"number"},{"text":", elapsedMs: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"100","kind":"number"},{"text":" }); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// { done: false, delayMs: 200 }","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Available policies include:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"fixedTemporalSchedule","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"500","kind":"number"},{"text":", { maxAttempts: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"3","kind":"number"},{"text":" });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"exponentialTemporalSchedule","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"100","kind":"number"},{"text":", { factor: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"2","kind":"number"},{"text":" });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"sequenceTemporalSchedule","kind":"function"},{"text":"([","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"100","kind":"number"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"250","kind":"number"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"1_000","kind":"number"},{"text":"]);","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"retry"},{"t":"text","text":" uses the temporal runtime for non-zero backoff delays and accepts a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"custom schedule when the built-in policies are not enough:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"user"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"yield","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"*","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"loadUser","kind":"function"},{"text":"().","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"pipe","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"retry","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      times: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"3","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      schedule: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"exponentialTemporalSchedule","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"200","kind":"number"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        factor: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"2","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        maxDelayMs: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"2_000","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  );","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Prefer a schedule over "},{"t":"code","text":"setInterval"},{"t":"text","text":" for polling. The operation completes one"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"step, the schedule decides whether another step is needed, and the next task"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"is created only after the current step has finished. This avoids accidental"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"overlap and makes destruction cancellable."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"ownership-and-cleanup","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Ownership and cleanup"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every task can carry an "},{"t":"code","text":"owner"},{"t":"text","text":" label for inspection. Runtime integrations that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"have a "},{"t":"code","text":"DestroyRef"},{"t":"text","text":" attach the task to that lifetime:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"task"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" runtime.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"schedule","kind":"function"},{"text":"(refresh, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"1_000","kind":"number"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  kind: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'polling'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  owner: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'user-list'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  destroyRef,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"task.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"cancel","kind":"function"},{"text":"(); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// idempotent; returns whether cancellation happened","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Destroying the owner cancels its pending tasks. A suspended "},{"t":"code","text":"craftSleep"},{"t":"text","text":" is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rejected with "},{"t":"code","text":"TemporalCancelledError"},{"t":"text","text":", so a destroyed program cannot resume"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and mutate state after its lifetime has ended."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"choosing-the-right-abstraction","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Choosing the right abstraction"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Need"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Use"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","text":"Wait once inside a generator"}],[{"t":"code","text":"craftSleep"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Bound an operation by a deadline"}],[{"t":"code","text":"withCraftTimeout"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Retry after an error"}],[{"t":"code","text":"retry"},{"t":"text","text":" with a schedule"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Repeat work without overlap"}],[{"t":"text","text":"one operation plus a schedule"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Store a timestamp"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a civil date value, not the monotonic clock"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Test time-dependent behavior"}],[{"t":"code","text":"VirtualCraftTemporalRuntime"}]]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-not-to-do","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What not to do"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Avoid timer Promises created directly inside Craft programs:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"// Avoid","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"yield","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"new","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"Promise","kind":"type"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"resolve"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"setTimeout","kind":"function"},{"text":"(resolve, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"500","kind":"number"},{"text":"));","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use the temporal request instead:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"// Prefer","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"yield","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftSleep","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"500","kind":"number"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Direct timer globals are reported by the "},{"t":"code","text":"no-direct-temporal-globals"},{"t":"text","text":" dev-tools"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rule. The temporal runtime implementation itself is the explicit exception."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"limitations","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Limitations"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Browser background-tab throttling is not simulated by the virtual runtime."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Microtasks and macrotasks remain distinct; advancing virtual time flushes the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"microtasks caused by the tasks it executes."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"RxJS schedulers are not replaced by the Craft runtime. The time operators of"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/reactivity/streams#time","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/stream"}]},{"t":"text","text":" ("},{"t":"code","text":"debounce"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"throttle"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"delay"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"timeout"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"retry"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"repeat"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"bufferTime"},{"t":"text","text":") do use it, and follow the virtual clock."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A timeout does not cancel an external resource unless that resource accepts"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and observes an abort signal."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Timers created by third-party APIs remain outside Craft ownership."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"see-also","children":[{"t":"text","tex